  <MouseDisaster_N004_MissingMother.stages.0.label>妈妈去哪儿了</MouseDisaster_N004_MissingMother.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_MissingMother.stages.0.description>今天它又想起了已经不在的妈妈。</MouseDisaster_N004_MissingMother.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_SurvivedCaptivity.stages.0.label>为了活下去吱</MouseDisaster_N004_SurvivedCaptivity.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_SurvivedCaptivity.stages.0.description>它活了下来，但每天都还得重新证明这一点。</MouseDisaster_N004_SurvivedCaptivity.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.0.label>妈妈还在</MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.0.description>妈妈还在这附近，今天也没有离开。</MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.1.label>宝宝还在</MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.1.label>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.1.description>孩子还在身边，事情暂时没有把它带走。</MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.1.description>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.2.label>宝宝还在</MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.2.label>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.2.description>孩子还在身边，事情暂时没有把它带走。</MouseDisaster_N004_FamilySurvived.stages.2.description>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_MotherRegret.stages.0.label>要是……</MouseDisaster_N004_MotherRegret.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_N004_MotherRegret.stages.0.description>她总会想到那一天，想知道哪一步本来可以不一样。</MouseDisaster_N004_MotherRegret.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBitten.stages.0.label>窝的尾巴，窝恨你</MouseDisaster_TailBitten.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBitten.stages.0.description>尾巴被生生咬断了。窝记住你了，三天都不会忘。</MouseDisaster_TailBitten.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBittenHatred.stages.0.label>窝的尾巴，窝恨你</MouseDisaster_TailBittenHatred.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBittenInjured.stages.0.label>尾巴痛痛</MouseDisaster_TailBittenInjured.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBittenInjured.stages.0.description>吱吱！尾巴痛痛！泥就是嫉妒窝尾巴比泥好看。</MouseDisaster_TailBittenInjured.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBiteSuccess.stages.0.label>尾巴比泥长</MouseDisaster_TailBiteSuccess.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBiteSuccess.stages.0.description>吱吱！窝尾巴比泥长多啦！好看！泥丑死啦。</MouseDisaster_TailBiteSuccess.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBiteFailed.stages.0.label>尾巴没咬掉</MouseDisaster_TailBiteFailed.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBiteFailed.stages.0.description>吱吱……尾巴没咬掉，被揍了一顿。</MouseDisaster_TailBiteFailed.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_TailCut.stages.0.label>尾巴流血</MouseDisaster_TailCut.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_TailCut.stages.0.description>尾巴被切了一刀，一直在流血，痛痛……</MouseDisaster_TailCut.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBruised.stages.0.label>尾巴淤伤</MouseDisaster_TailBruised.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_TailBruised.stages.0.description>尾巴被捶得青一块紫一块，走路都不太想走了。</MouseDisaster_TailBruised.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_EarTorn.stages.0.label>耳朵没啦</MouseDisaster_EarTorn.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_EarTorn.stages.0.description>吱吱吱！耳朵没啦！泥就是嫉妒！泥耳朵丑丑。</MouseDisaster_EarTorn.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_EarInjured.stages.0.label>耳朵痛痛</MouseDisaster_EarInjured.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_EarInjured.stages.0.description>叽叽……耳朵痛痛……但窝耳朵还是比泥好看。</MouseDisaster_EarInjured.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_BeggingSucceeded.stages.0.label>讨到吃的了</MouseDisaster_BeggingSucceeded.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_BeggingSucceeded.stages.0.description>总算讨到一点能入口的东西了，今天还能再活一下。</MouseDisaster_BeggingSucceeded.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_BeggingRejected.stages.0.label>乞讨被拒</MouseDisaster_BeggingRejected.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_BeggingRejected.stages.0.description>明明只是想活下去，却还是被冷眼赶开了。</MouseDisaster_BeggingRejected.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_OverGnawedWallThought.stages.0.label>啃食墙皮</MouseDisaster_OverGnawedWallThought.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_OverGnawedWallThought.stages.0.description>啃食墙皮，这真的是能吃的吗。</MouseDisaster_OverGnawedWallThought.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Kind.stages.0.label>看见乞讨鼠族</MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Kind.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Kind.stages.0.description>看见饥饿的鼠灾流民在乞讨，心里有点难受。</MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Kind.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Psychopath.stages.0.label>看见乞讨鼠族</MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Psychopath.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Psychopath.stages.0.description>看见鼠灾流民在乞讨，让人兴奋得有点愉快。</MouseDisaster_SawBeggarRatkin_Psychopath.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_BloodlineContinuation.stages.0.label>血脉延续</MouseDisaster_BloodlineContinuation.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_BloodlineContinuation.stages.0.description>不在乎是谁的，只要能生下来就够了。</MouseDisaster_BloodlineContinuation.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_BloodlineRenewed.stages.0.label>血脉赓续</MouseDisaster_BloodlineRenewed.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_BloodlineRenewed.stages.0.description>莫名地开心，看到孩子顺利出生。</MouseDisaster_BloodlineRenewed.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.0.label>粑粑麻麻是带窝去玩，叽叽</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.0.description>粑粑麻麻就在身边，窝只是跟着一起出门玩。</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.0.description>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.1.label>窝被粑粑麻麻卖掉了</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.1.label>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.1.description>窝被交给了别人，还成了囚犯。</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.1.description>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.2.label>窝被卖掉了吱</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.2.label>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.2.description>窝被交给了别人，还成了囚犯。可窝本来就没有粑粑麻麻。</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.2.description>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.3.label>窝只系来玩叽</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.3.label>
  <MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.3.description>窝只是被带出来转转，叽叽，没什么好怕的。</MouseDisaster_ChildExchangeFamilyMood.stages.3.description>
  <MouseDisaster_VisitorSheltered.stages.0.label>被好心人收留了吱</MouseDisaster_VisitorSheltered.stages.0.label>
  <MouseDisaster_VisitorSheltered.stages.0.description>终于有人肯让窝活下来了。这里给了窝一口饭、一张床，还有继续活着的机会。</MouseDisaster_VisitorSheltered.stages.0.description>
